1)Is cloudRun similar to GKE ?
Cloud Run and GKE both run containers, but Cloud Run is fully serverless — 
I only push a container, and Google handles scaling, networking, and infrastructure.
GKE is a full Kubernetes platform where I manage clusters, nodes, deployments, autoscaling, and networking.
Cloud Run is simpler and cost-effective, while GKE is for complex or large-scale workloads requiring full Kubernetes control.

